  kind: 1
  title: "Ki\u1EC3m tra nhanh \u2014 ng\xE0y 2"
  intro: "B\xE0i tr\xEAn l\u1EDBp: c\xE2u h\u1ECFi nhi\u1EC5u nhi\u1EC1u h\u01A1n.
    Ch\u1ECDn \u0111\xE1p \xE1n ch\u1EB7t ch\u1EBD nh\u1EA5t (ki\u1EC3u event h\xE0i
    h\u01B0\u1EDBc)."
  questions:
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 2] Kh\xE1i ni\u1EC7m 'idempotency' trong API
      th\u01B0\u1EDDng nh\u1EAFm t\u1EDBi \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "G\u1ECDi l\u1EB7p l\u1EA1i m\u1ED9t thao t\xE1c kh\xF4ng l\xE0m thay \u0111\u1ED5i
      tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i th\xEAm l\u1EA7n n\u1EEFa (\xFD t\u01B0\u1EDFng)"
    - "M\xE3 h\xF3a m\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u"
    - "Lu\xF4n tr\u1EA3 200 OK"
    - "Kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n authentication"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 2] M\u1ED9t ch\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\xECnh c\xF3
      v\xF2ng l\u1EB7p v\xF4 h\u1EA1n do \u0111i\u1EC1u ki\u1EC7n sai. L\u1ED7i g\u1EA7n
      lo\u1EA1i n\xE0o nh\u1EA5t?"
    options:
    - "Logic / l\u1ED7i thu\u1EADt to\xE1n \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n"
    - "L\u1ED7i c\xFA ph\xE1p parse"
    - "L\u1ED7i linker"
    - "L\u1ED7i permission file"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 2] Trong thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF DB, 'kh\xF3a ngo\u1EA1i'
      (foreign key) nh\u1EB1m\u2026"
    options:
    - "R\xE0ng bu\u1ED9c tham chi\u1EBFu gi\u1EEFa b\u1EA3ng"
    - "T\u0103ng t\u1ED1c sort RAM"
    - "M\xE3 h\xF3a c\u1ED9t"
    - "T\u1EA1o index t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng m\u1ECDi tr\u01B0\u1EDDng h\u1EE3p"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 2] SQL: 'JOIN' d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m
      g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "K\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p h\xE0ng t\u1EEB nhi\u1EC1u b\u1EA3ng theo \u0111i\u1EC1u
      ki\u1EC7n"
    - "X\xF3a b\u1EA3ng"
    - "T\u1EA1o user"
    - Backup
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 2] Ch\u1ECDn m\u1EC7nh \u0111\u1EC1 \u0111\xFAng
      v\u1EC1 'version control' (Git, \xFD t\u01B0\u1EDFng):"
    options:
    - "Commit l\u01B0u snapshot l\u1ECBch s\u1EED \u0111\u1EC3 quay lui/merge"
    - "Branch lu\xF4n l\xE0m m\u1EA5t code"
